      "description": "中文名称与 Pixel 短标签共同标明档案；当前页使用透白内边框。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-shelf\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a class=\"ds-file\" href=\"#plans\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 26\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 7V2h12v5h14v17H2z\" fill=\"#f3d8e6\" stroke=\"#b18ba5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span>策划案作品集<small>DESIGN DOCS</small></span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-shelf{padding:9px;background:var(--glass,rgba(245,251,255,.46));border:1px solid var(--glass-edge,rgba(255,255,255,.86));border-radius:12px;backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(1.12)}.ds-file{display:grid;grid-template-columns:35px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:74px;padding:10px 6px;border-radius:7px;color:var(--foreground,#334657);text-decoration:none;font:12px/1.4 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;transition:background .2s,transform .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-file small{display:block;margin-top:4px;font:11px/1.3 Pixel,Fusion,monospace;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted-foreground,#596774)}.ds-file:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.54);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-file:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-file[aria-current=page]{background:rgba(255,255,255,.74);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px white}.ds-file:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--sky-11,#00749e);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-file{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Demo 分类标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "demo-chip",
      "description": "仅展示原型分类，没有筛选行为。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">玩法实验</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-block;background:var(--pink-3,#fee9f5);color:var(--memo-foreground,#75475f);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:3px;font:10px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}"
    },
    {
      "name": "毛玻璃窗口",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "glass-window",
      "description": "Sky alpha 标题栏与半透明玻璃框。装饰窗控件为非交互图形。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-glass\"><div class=\"ds-title\"><span>portfolio.journal</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">− □</span></div><div class=\"ds-window-content\">作品档案</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-glass{background:var(--glass,rgba(245,251,255,.46));border:1px solid var(--glass-edge,rgba(255,255,255,.86));border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--glass-shadow,0 18px 48px rgba(55,91,120,.15),0 3px 9px rgba(55,91,120,.09));backdrop-filter:blur(18px) saturate(1.12);overflow:hidden;color:var(--foreground,#334657)}.ds-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:34px;padding:6px 12px;background:var(--sky-a3,#00b3ee1e);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.6);font:13px/1.3 Pixel,Fusion,monospace;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted-foreground,#596774)}.ds-window-content{padding:16px;font:14px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}@supports not (backdrop-filter:blur(1px)){.ds-glass{background:#e7f1f9}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "身份便签",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "memo",
      "description": "粉色虚线纸、半透明胶带与小角度旋转。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-memo\"><span class=\"ds-tape\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>姓名待填写</strong><p>从设计文档到可玩的原型。<br>把规则、实验与迭代，放在同一页。</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-memo{position:relative;max-width:440px;margin:14px 8px;background:var(--memo,#fee9f5);color:var(--memo-foreground,#75475f);padding:24px 27px 20px;border:1px dashed var(--memo-border,#efbfdd);transform:rotate(-1.2deg);box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(127,87,111,.09)}.ds-memo strong{font:400 20px/1.7 Fusion,sans-serif}.ds-memo p{margin:12px 0 0;font:13px/1.9 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}.ds-tape{position:absolute;left:calc(50% - 35px);top:-11px;width:70px;height:22px;background:rgba(212,229,237,.67);border-left:2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.7);border-right:2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.7);transform:rotate(-4deg);pointer-events:none}"
    },
    {
      "name": "装订纸页",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "实心奶油白阅读面，用装订孔和粉色细线建立手账材质。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-paper\"><h2>策划案作品集</h2><p>设计目标、规则与验证过程。</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-paper{position:relative;min-height:200px;background:var(--paper,#fffdf9);color:var(--foreground,#334657);padding:35px 34px 24px 53px;border-radius:5px 5px 8px 8px;box-shadow:var(--paper-shadow,0 7px 20px rgba(64,85,111,.08))}.ds-paper:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:13px;top:30px;bottom:25px;width:16px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 8px 12px,#d9e4ed 0 4px,#fff 5px 6px,transparent 7px);background-size:16px 58px}.ds-paper:after{content:'';position:absolute;left:38px;top:18px;bottom:18px;width:1px;background:var(--pink-6,#efbfdd)}.ds-paper h2{margin:0;font:400 30px/1.4 Fusion,'Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif}.ds-paper p{margin:5px 0 0;font:12px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;color:var(--muted-foreground,#596774)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "文档封面",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "纸页条目的轻微倾斜封面，悬停转正并出现纸影。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cover\"><span>SYSTEM<br>DESIGN</span><small>DESIGN DOC<br>文档封面展示位</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-cover{position:relative;width:126px;min-height:155px;padding:17px 13px;background:var(--sky-3,#e1f6fd);border:1px solid var(--sky-6,#a9daed);border-radius:2px;transform:rotate(-2deg);overflow:hidden;transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .3s;color:var(--foreground,#334657)}.ds-cover:before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:9px;width:1px;background:var(--sky-7,#8dcae3)}.ds-cover>span{display:block;margin-left:7px;font:23px/1.05 Pixel,Fusion,monospace;letter-spacing:.04em}.ds-cover small{position:absolute;bottom:15px;left:20px;right:8px;font:9px/1.7 'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;color:var(--muted-foreground,#596774)}.ds-cover:hover{transform:rotate(0);box-shadow:0 6px 12px rgba(71,99,125,.12)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-cover{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "天空上的作品手账",
    "overview": "淡蓝像素云铺满屏幕，毛玻璃窗口承载导航与工具，奶油色纸页承载正文。桌面上的文件架、手账、便签和像素贴纸形成轻松的游戏策划工作台。像素轮廓集中在标题、短英文标签和装饰，长段说明保持清晰的无衬线字形。\n\n这套系统服务于招聘者阅读简历、策划文档和试玩原型。错落与倾斜属于桌面构图；手机将入口和内容按阅读顺序展开。当前内容来自 `dist/content.js` 的待填写框架，资料、链接和成果状态由实际内容决定。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "全屏淡蓝像素云，毛玻璃 HUD 窗口与奶油色阅读纸页。",
      "中文像素标题、英文像素标签与清晰的无衬线正文。",
      "粉色便签、淡紫纸签、装订孔和原创像素贴纸。",
      "桌面窗口错落叠放，手机使用原生单列阅读布局。",
      "FX 本地偏好、系统减少动态效果与后台暂停共同控制天空和粒子。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Paper Contrast Rule",
        "body": "正文放在纸页或明确的窗口内容面上；天空透光留给玻璃边框与工具区域。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Short Pixel Rule",
        "body": "像素字体用于标题、短标签与短句；策划规则、简历经历和详情字段使用正文栈。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Sky Layer Rule",
        "body": "根元素保留固定天空渐变；body 使用透明背景与隔离堆叠上下文。CSS 天空在 z-index 0，WebGL 天空在 1，页面工具与主工作台在 2，粒子在 8。Toast 在 30，原生模态 dialog 使用浏览器 top layer。天空不依赖负 z-index。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 沿用 Sky / Mauve / Pink 语义映射，并保留作者定义的奶油纸、莓灰文字与雾白玻璃材质。",
      "**Do** 将正文放在清晰纸页上，将透光和模糊用于窗口外框与工具面。",
      "**Do** 保持标题、短标签和贴纸的像素轮廓，让长段正文使用无衬线字体。",
      "**Do** 保持根天空、CSS 天空、WebGL 天空和页面内容的明确层序。",
      "**Do** 遵循 FX、减少动态效果、后台暂停、键盘焦点与待添加状态。",
      "**Do** 在手机按阅读顺序展开窗口，保留至少 44px 的操作高度和全部内容路由。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 恢复旧的深色 Sage / Jade / Mint 庭院视觉或将未加载的旧资产写成当前组件。",
      "**Don't** 用不透明 body 背景盖住天空，或把天空放入负 z-index 层。",
      "**Don't** 给装饰窗口控件和贴纸添加虚假的操作语义。",
      "**Don't** 用像素字体排长段策划正文，或让动效成为访问内容的前提。",
      "**Don't** 将占位文案、空链接或装饰资产描述成真实项目、成绩与经历。"
    ]
  }
}
